name: Polychrome Tag — free polychrome joker
author: corpus
description: >-
  Polychrome Tag makes the next base-edition Joker in a shop become Polychrome (X1.5 Mult)
  and free. First-shop skip reward: pair with X-mult jokers (The Order, The Tribe, Baron)
  and Showman.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - tag: PolychromeTag
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      tags: true
should:
  - joker: TheOrder
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheTribe
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
